  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "しんだように　まったく　うごかないが\nふれると　ほのかに　あたたかい。\nおおむかしは　ほしのマユと　よばれた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "죽은 것처럼 전혀 움직이지 않지만\n만지면 어렴풋이 따뜻하다.\n아주 옛날에는 달의 고치로 불렸다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "就像死去一樣動也不動，\n但觸碰後會感到些許溫暖。\n在遙遠的過去被稱為星之繭。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On pourrait le croire mort car il ne bouge pas\ndu tout. Au toucher, il reste tiède. On le\nsurnomme « cocon céleste » depuis l’Antiquité.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ist völlig reglos, als wäre es tot. Berührt man\nes, fühlt es sich jedoch leicht warm an. Vor\nlanger Zeit wurde es „Sternenkokon“ genannt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Permanece inmóvil, como si estuviera muerto,\naunque al tocarlo se percibe un ligero calor.\nAntaño se le llamaba Crisálida de las Estrellas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Resta completamente immobile, come se fosse\nmorto, ma al tatto si percepisce un lieve tepore.\nNell’antichità era chiamato “Bozzolo di stella”.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Motionless as if dead, its body is faintly warm to\nthe touch. In the distant past, it was called the\ncocoon of the stars.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "死んだように　まったく　動かないが\n触れると　ほのかに　温かい。\n大昔は　星の繭と　呼ばれた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "就像死了一般几乎不动，\n但触碰后有些许温暖。\n在遥远的过去被称为星之茧。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Permanece inmóvil, como si estuviera muerto,\naunque al tocarlo se percibe un ligero calor.\nAntaño se le llamaba Crisálida de las Estrellas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かたいカラの　なかで　くろいコアに\nなにかが　あつまり　つづけている。\nべつせかいの　ポケモンと　いわれる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "단단한 껍질 안의 검은 코어에\n무언가가 계속 모여들고 있다.\n다른 세계의 포켓몬으로 전해진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在堅硬的外殼內，有著某種東西\n在不斷地向黑色核心聚集著。\n據說是屬於其他世界的寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sous sa lourde carapace, il amasse secrètement\nquelque chose en son sombre noyau.\nIl viendrait d’un autre monde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Unter seiner harten Schale häuft sich\nunaufhörlich etwas in seinem schwarzen Kern\nan. Es soll aus einer anderen Welt stammen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se dice que es un Pokémon procedente de otro\nmundo. Alrededor del núcleo negro que alberga\nsu duro caparazón parece acumularse algo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nel nucleo nero all’interno del suo duro\nesoscheletro continua ad accumularsi qualcosa.\nSi dice che provenga da un altro mondo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "There’s something accumulating around the\nblack core within its hard shell. People think\nthis Pokémon may come from another world.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "硬いカラの　中で　黒いコアに\nなにかが　集まり　続けている。\n別世界の　ポケモンと　いわれる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在坚硬外壳内，有什么\n在源源不断地向黑色内核聚集着。\n据说是其他世界的宝可梦。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se dice que es un Pokémon procedente de otro\nmundo. Alrededor del núcleo negro que alberga\nsu duro caparazón parece acumularse algo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "たいこ　アローラを　しはい　していた\nおうさまは　ほしのまゆと　よんで\nあがめるための　さいだんを　つくった。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "먼 옛날 알로라를 지배하던\n왕은 별의 고치라고 부르며\n숭상하기 위한 제단을 만들었다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "太古時代支配著阿羅拉的國王\n稱呼牠為星之繭，\n為了崇拜牠而建造了祭壇。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un antique roi d’Alola lui a donné le surnom\nde « cocon céleste » et a même érigé un autel\nen son honneur.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ein vor Urzeiten über Alola herrschender König\nnannte es „Sternenkokon“ und erbaute ihm zu\nEhren ein Podium.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En la antigüedad, un rey de Alola lo apodó\nCrisálida de las Estrellas y erigió un altar en su\nhonor.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un antico re di Alola gli diede il nome di\n“Bozzolo di stella” e costruì un altare\nper venerarlo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The king who ruled Alola in times of antiquity\ncalled it the “cocoon of the stars” and built\nan altar to worship it.",
      "language": {
